kavis-taskmanager (1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split out of kavis-tools (feedback G1): the task manager is its own
    binary, .desktop entry and icon instead of `kavis-tools tasks`.
  * The "End task" button is gone (feedback G2); a right-click menu and
    Delete / Shift+Delete replace it.

